# Checks whether the rule is violated in the diff range BASE_SHA..HEAD_SHA.
# If a violation is detected and remediation is possible, auto-fixes and exits 0.
# If a violation is detected and cannot be auto-fixed, exits 1.
#
# Usage:
#   {{script_name}}.sh <base-sha> <head-sha>
#
# Exit codes:
#   0  — success (no violation, or violation auto-fixed)
